{
  "info": {
    "name": "E-Commerce API",
    "description": "Run the folders in order (Collection Runner works). Folder \"5. Security proofs\" shows that a user cannot reach another user's data or perform operations outside their role.\nAuth routes are rate-limited (10/min/IP).",
